# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows rewrites every file between LF and CRLF, which
# makes whole files look changed when nothing in them has. That noise already
# cost us once: fetch_s2.py was silently dropped from version control during a
# commit because it looked entirely rewritten. See changes.md, Phase 2 (g).
#
# "text=auto eol=lf" stores everything with LF in the repository, regardless of
# what the working copy uses.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tif binary
*.pt  binary

# Notebooks are JSON; treat as text but do not try to merge them line by line
*.ipynb text eol=lf
